        "text": "Mobile usability and speed are separate topics. Page speed on phones is covered in our [Core Web Vitals checklist](/guides/core-web-vitals-checklist-for-a-medical-practice-website), and markup in our guide to [schema for a medical practice website](/guides/schema-markup-for-a-medical-practice-website-explained)."
