          "Create a spreadsheet matching each old URL to one new URL with the closest content. Avoid sending everything to the homepage, since Google treats blanket redirects like errors.",
          "Keep the structure, titles, headings, and copy as close to identical as you can. Redesign and move as two separate projects, not one.",
